+# Compression Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Zstd (Zstandard) as the codec for the compression layer, chosen for its superior compression ratio while maintaining performance characteristics that meet the project's requirements. The decision was recorded on 2026-09-26. No compression level or other tuning parameters are recorded.
